    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A man receives a surprising letter from an old love, revealing that years ago, she was pregnant with his child, who was put up for adoption. Determined to make things right, he embarks on a journey to find his lost child. As he searches, he revisits memories of his past and uncovers long-buried truths. Along the way, he meets a mysterious young girl, and together, they follow clues and half-remembered moments to track down the child he never knew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dive into a world of living characters and real consequences.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3112280/extras/02d810e8ca555344c686e50da1076fd1.avif?t=1748782522\" width=616 height=220 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience intense and thrilling moments with hot scenes.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3112280/extras/13ead863160aaa63666b45fb2585ae3b.poster.avif?t=1748782522\" width=624 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3112280/extras/13ead863160aaa63666b45fb2585ae3b.webm?t=1748782522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3112280/extras/13ead863160aaa63666b45fb2585ae3b.mp4?t=1748782522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3112280/extras/c6536b702f8f8833115b8e327e2542ca.poster.avif?t=1748782522\" width=622 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3112280/extras/c6536b